  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/10/P1690094.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(35 fotos) El bar-restaurante Toga, en la plaza de Espa&ntilde;a, 17, en Onda, ofrece una gran variedad de tapas, bocadillos, platos combinados y men&uacute; diario a 8,50 euros, adem&aacute;s de arroz cada jueves y domingo, y tambi&eacute;n fideu&agrave;, en el interior en o en terraza cubierta o descubierta.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bartoga/img-20170929-wa0004.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170929-wa0004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bartoga/img-20170929-wa0005.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170929-wa0005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bartoga/img-20170929-wa0006.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170929-wa0006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bartoga/img-20170929-wa0007.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170929-wa0007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bartoga/img-20170929-wa0008.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170929-wa0008\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bartoga/img-20170929-wa0009.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170929-wa0009\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bartoga/img-20170929-wa0010.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170929-wa0010\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bartoga/img-20170929-wa0011.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170929-wa0011\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bartoga/img-20170929-wa0012.jpg\" alt=\"img-201709